      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "scenario_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_unit_overlay",
            image: "items/gold-coins-small.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We have recovered our gold; it is well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "gold_carrier",
            text: _("We have recovered much more than our own treasure. These saurians would seem to have taken up robbery as a vocation!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("They took all our treasure! Quickly, place ambushers on all trails from here to Wesmere. I will give 500 gold to whoever kills their leader. They must not escape."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Turnabout is fair play. Now that we’ve retrieved the gold, let us fare swiftly back to Wesmere and bring the gold back as Cleodil wishes. The saurians will likely be infesting the direct route, so we will detour to the north."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("But Kalenz, this is a boon unlooked for! With the surplus gold we could take the war immediately to the orcs. We could come down upon them like thunder while they believe us still reeling from their invasion!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("But the Ka’lian’s gold is the Ka’lian’s. Would you have us divide our forces, some to return it to them while others attempt your thunder-stroke?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Cleodil’s doubt is wise. Only a foolish commander divides his forces in the presence of superior numbers; to do so is to invite defeat in detail."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Landar, thoughts that brew in hot blood are seldom well-found."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It... is so. Again you speak wisdom. Very well; to the Ka’lian!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "amount_gold",
            value: 1800,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You retrieve $amount_gold pieces of gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "gold",
            side: 1,
            amount: 1800,
          },
        ],
      },
